{"id":"vod_bf_13423","vodId":"13423","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"红伤骑士X","name_cn":"红伤骑士X","date":"2016-01-01","year":"2016","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"完结","images":{"common":"https://p.bfvp26.com/upload/vod/20230424-14/b8b5c3d4236bc9afbb35db25896103e7.jpg"},"summary":"舞台是象征理性的「青之世界」，然而正在遭受由本能支配的「红之世界」的生命体NightflyO’Note的袭击与侵略。17岁的主人公麻黄Akira就职为青之世界研究员，随后因为能力出众而被提拔为最前线的战斗指挥官，受命负责横跨石垣岛和西表岛而构成的对位相外防卫机关，通称「琉球LAG」。在那里她遇见了在第五战斗单元经过激战而全军覆灭之后，于四年前成立的第六战斗单元「IS」的学生们。主人公作为教官，率领着又称「Scared Rider Xechs」的6名骑手（Rider），共同浴血奋战，应对来自异世界的攻击和威胁。在这样的生活中，他们的友情也在逐渐加深。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-06-10 03:12:10","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/hongshangqishiX/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/hongshangqishiX/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/hongshangqishiX/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/hongshangqishiX/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/hongshangqishiX/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/hongshangqishiX/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/hongshangqishiX/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/hongshangqishiX/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/hongshangqishiX/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/hongshangqishiX/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/hongshangqishiX/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/hongshangqishiX/第12集/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:42:31.246Z"}